00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.620
Hannah wrote in and says, Recession soon.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.650
Hi, David.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:33.870
I'm hearing more news stories that say the
U.S. is barreling toward recession right now

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.110
and that this recession will start within
the next year.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:37.110
Do you agree?

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:38.110
Why or why not?

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.110
Thank you, Hanna.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.620
Here's the difficulty of this question.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:43.569
We may already be in a recession.

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:45.230
We may be getting out of it right now.

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:49.150
We you know, everybody defines it differently.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:54.819
Understand that for a decade, many have been
saying a recession is imminent.

00:06:54.819 --> 00:06:58.940
Around 2015, there were lots of people saying
a recession is imminent.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:03.470
Imagine if you had listened to them in 2015
and said, I believe the recession is imminent.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:05.330
I'm getting out of the stock market.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:11.250
You would have missed one of the greatest
run ups in the stock market in decades.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.870
So my view is I don't know if a recession
is coming.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.130
I can't control whether a recession is coming.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.960
At some point there will be another recession.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:20.960
What do I know?

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:21.960
Well, I know my principles.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:28.210
I know that my principle is asset allocation
and my principle is low cost index funds without

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:29.590
trying to time the market.

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:36.169
And my principle is when the market goes down,
those same index fund purchases get me more

00:07:36.169 --> 00:07:39.300
shares at a lower price because I can't time
it.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.050
I don't know whether a recession is coming.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:46.371
And so I think a lot of times the right question
to ask is if a recession were coming, what

00:07:46.371 --> 00:07:49.139
would I do or what would I do differently?

00:07:49.139 --> 00:07:51.380
For most people, the answer is, well, actually
nothing.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.699
I wouldn't do anything differently.

00:07:52.699 --> 00:07:56.099
So I don't have the answer about a recession.

00:07:56.099 --> 00:07:59.090
But what I do have is a plan.

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.930
That is the plan whether or not we are in
a recession.

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:04.240
I hope that makes sense.

